    "caption": "排灯节",
    "title": "排灯节灯笼，孟买，马哈拉施特拉邦，印度",
    "description": "一年中最黑暗的夜晚遇上最明亮的庆典，会是什么景象？答案就是排灯节。世界各地数百万人庆祝这个灯节，点亮油灯和灯笼，绘制兰戈利彩绘，祈祷、品尝甜点，并与家人团聚。",
    "copyright": "© Dinodia Photo/Getty Images",
    "date": "2026 11月 8",
    "clickUrl": "/search?q=%e6%8e%92%e7%81%af%e8%8a%82&form=hpcapt&filters=HpDate:\"20261107_1600\"",
    "imageUrls": {
      "landscape": {
        "highDef": "/th?id=OHR.DiwaliLamps_ZH-CN2462894749_1920x1080.jpg",
        "ultraHighDef": "/th?id=OHR.DiwaliLamps_ZH-CN2462894749_UHD.jpg",
        "wallpaper": "/th?id=OHR.DiwaliLamps_ZH-CN2462894749_1920x1200.jpg"
      },
      "portrait": {
        "highDef": "/th?id=OHR.DiwaliLamps_ZH-CN2462894749_768x1366.jpg",
